        <mxCell id="m-bus-lbl" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;b&gt;EventBridge — duckstore-event-bus&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;(FoundationStack, imported by fixed name)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:normal;color:#5A6C86&quot;&gt;Every integration event crosses this one bus. Producers publish through CDC — a committed DynamoDB write → Streams → a publisher Lambda (ADR-0005); consumers are wired by one rule per detail-type.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="78" width="1900" x="220" y="921" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
