        <mxCell id="pr-note-down" parent="pr-cloud" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#116045;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;strokeColor=#1A7F5A;fillColor=#F3FAF7;spacing=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Downstream consumer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;catalogview-pricing-sync-consumer&lt;/i&gt; (PricingSync, ADR-0044) receives both events and refreshes the search document&#39;s price.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A campaign never writes to &lt;i&gt;prices&lt;/i&gt; — without the product-discounts publisher, CatalogView would keep the pre-campaign price forever." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="132" width="295" x="1469" y="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pr-note" parent="pr-cloud" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6C86;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Four modules, six tables.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Prices&lt;/b&gt; — nominal price; publishes &lt;i&gt;PriceChangedEvent&lt;/i&gt; via CDC.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Campaigns&lt;/b&gt; — promotional campaigns; create/end writes &lt;i&gt;campaigns&lt;/i&gt; + &lt;i&gt;product-discounts&lt;/i&gt; in one TransactWriteItems (ADR-0026 §6).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GatewayCosts&lt;/b&gt; — per-provider cost feeding the installment calculation (ADR-0028).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CustomerDiscounts&lt;/b&gt; — customer coupon, minted from &lt;i&gt;PointsRedeemedEvent&lt;/i&gt; and burned on &lt;i&gt;PaymentAuthorizedEvent&lt;/i&gt; (ADR-0046).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Basket never calls Pricing&lt;/b&gt; — neither sync nor async (ADR-0026).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Query.rewardConversion&lt;/b&gt; is a NONE (local) resolver: values are baked in at synth time, no backend call (ADR-0046 §8)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="320" width="295" x="1469" y="865" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
