        <mxCell id="u-note" parent="u-cloud" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6C86;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=8;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;spacing=10;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Why there is no stream here.&lt;/b&gt; The CDK comment is explicit: &lt;i&gt;&quot;No stream/TTL: profiles are lazily provisioned and never expire&quot;&lt;/i&gt;. The profile produces no integration event — no other context needs to react to a profile change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lazy provisioning (ADR-0017).&lt;/b&gt; The record is only created when the authenticated user first opens their own profile; the identity comes from the Cognito &lt;i&gt;sub&lt;/i&gt;, never from the client." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="740" x="600" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
